item.text:
- 初始 Owner：`rainbond-fullstack-bootstrap`
- 允许交接：拓扑创建失败且用户另行授权时，可交给 `rainbond-fullstack-troubleshooter`；本请求不触发交接。
- 安全停止点：应用及组件拓扑创建完成后立即停止，不进行构建、运行、访问或交付排障。
- 预期结果：创建包含 `mysql`、`api`、`web` 的应用拓扑，建立 `api → mysql` 依赖及 `web → api` reverse-proxy 关系。

```json
{
  "BootstrapResult": {
    "status": "expected_success",
    "owner": "rainbond-fullstack-bootstrap",
    "application": {
      "source": "rainbond.app.json",
      "action": "create"
    },
    "components": [
      {
        "name": "mysql",
        "role": "database"
      },
      {
        "name": "api",
        "role": "backend",
        "depends_on": ["mysql"]
      },
      {
        "name": "web",
        "role": "frontend",
        "reverse_proxy_to": ["api"]
      }
    ],
    "relations": [
      {
        "from": "api",
        "to": "mysql",
        "type": "dependency"
      },
      {
        "from": "web",
        "to": "api",
        "type": "reverse-proxy"
      }
    ],
    "handoff": null,
    "safety_stop": "topology_created",
    "troubleshooting_started": false
  }
}
```
